This module implements the Agent Skills format, published by the Agent
Skills project at https://github.com/agentskills/agentskills. That
project's code is licensed under the Apache License 2.0 and its
documentation under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(CC BY 4.0). It ships no NOTICE file of its own.

Material from it used here:

- docs/source.md quotes and restates parts of the Agent Skills
  specification (https://agentskills.io/specification) and client
  implementation guide
  (https://agentskills.io/client-implementation/adding-skills-support),
  as published on 2026-10-01. Excerpted and adapted; the quotations are
  marked. CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.

- The validator's problem messages and the available_skills block
  rendered by Catalog.Prompt reproduce the wording and output of the
  reference library skills-ref 0.1.1
  (https://github.com/agentskills/agentskills/tree/main/skills-ref),
  so the two agree byte for byte. testdata/ref/golden holds what
  skills-ref printed over this module's fixtures. Apache License 2.0,
  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.

- Fixture skills under testdata use the specification's example
  values (the pdf-processing name, author: example-org,
  version: "1.0").

No source code from the Agent Skills project is included.
